| INT# | GPIO23, EXT_IRQ0 |
| RST# | GPIO29 |

It seems there are drivers available from Dragino2 board (but using SPI-GPIO bitbanging) -> https://github.com/villagetelco/vt-fxs-packages/tree/master/dragino2-si3217x

