==== USB mod ====
The board is ready to support an USB host port. We only need to solder a few components
  * ''F1:       0 ohm resistor''
  * ''R166:     0 ohm resistor ''
  * ''R15, R13: 0 ~ 120 ohm resistor. Recommended: 22 ohm ''
  * Optional: C163, C155, C125, C118: ceramic capacitors with high capacity.

